### TiendaBox - Pruebas del recurso Category
### Ejecutar en orden. El login del owner se hace una sola vez (caso 0) y su
### token se reutiliza automaticamente en los casos que lo necesitan.
### GET son publicos; POST/PUT/DELETE requieren login como owner.

@host = http://localhost:3000

### 0. Login owner -> 200 OK
# @name loginOwner
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@tiendabox.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 1. Crear categoria (owner) -> 201 Created
# @name createCategory
POST {{host}}/api/category
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "Auriculares",
  "description": "Auriculares y audifonos"
}

### 2. Crear categoria sin token -> 401 No autenticado
POST {{host}}/api/category
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sin auth"
}

### 3. Crear categoria sin name -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/api/category
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.$.token}}

{}

### 4. Crear categoria con name > 100 caracteres -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{host}}/api/category
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAX"
}

### 5. Crear categoria con nombre repetido -> 409 Conflict
POST {{host}}/api/category
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "Auriculares"
}

### 6. Listar todas las categorias (publico) -> 200 OK
GET {{host}}/api/categories

### 7. Obtener categoria por id (publico) -> 200 OK
# Usa el id devuelto en el caso 1, sin copiar y pegar nada.
GET {{host}}/api/category/{{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}

### 8. Obtener categoria inexistente -> 404 Not Found
GET {{host}}/api/category/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 9. Actualizar categoria (owner) -> 200 OK
PUT {{host}}/api/category/{{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "description": "Auriculares, audifonos y headsets"
}

### 10. Actualizar categoria sin token -> 401 No autenticado
PUT {{host}}/api/category/{{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Sin auth"
}

### 11. Actualizar con body vacio (owner) -> 400 Bad Request
PUT {{host}}/api/category/{{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.$.token}}

{}

### 12. Actualizar categoria inexistente (owner) -> 404 Not Found
PUT {{host}}/api/category/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "name": "Otra"
}

### 13. Eliminar categoria (owner) -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{host}}/api/category/{{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.$.token}}

### 14. Eliminar de nuevo la misma categoria -> 404 Not Found
DELETE {{host}}/api/category/{{createCategory.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginOwner.response.body.$.token}}
